another vote for ddply, specifically:

ddply(df, "year", summarize, cru_mean_ppt = mean(cru_mean_ppt),
udel_mean_ppt = mean(udel_mean_ppt), ... etc.)

note that you can do other functions at the same time, like sd(), not just
mean().

